### Alta producto simple (variante Única)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Resma A4 75g",
  "variants": [
    {
      "label": "Única",
      "price": 8500.00
    }
  ]
}

### Alta producto con dos marcas (cambiar categoryId y brandId)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cuaderno A4 rayado",
  "categoryId": 2,
  "variants": [
    {
      "brandId": 2,
      "label": "Rivadavia",
      "barcode": "7790000000001",
      "price": 2500.00,
      "imageUrl": "https://ejemplo.com/rivadavia.jpg"
    },
    {
      "brandId": 3,
      "label": "Gloria",
      "barcode": "7790000000002",
      "price": 2300.00,
      "imageUrl": "https://ejemplo.com/gloria.jpg"
    }
  ]
}

### Listado
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### Un producto (cambiar el id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### Editar ficha
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Resma A4 75g",
  "description": "500 hojas",
  "vatRate": 21.00,
  "allowsEmployeeDiscount": true
}

### Agregar variante
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/3/variants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Defectuosa Rivadavia",
  "price": 4000.00,
  "itemCondition": "DEFECTUOSA",
  "imageUrl": "https://ejemplo.com/rivadavia-defectuosa.jpg"
}

### Editar variante
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1/variants/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Chamex",
  "price": 8400.00,
  "imageUrl": "https://ejemplo.com/chamex.jpg"
}

### Baja variante
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/3/variants/5

### Reactivar variante
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/3/variants/3/activate

### Baja todas las variantes
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/3/variants/deactivate

### Baja producto
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/3

### Reactivar producto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/3/activate
